omb County record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids August to September and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 55% of normal in August to September and 56% in September to October. Grid 27490 had its driest year in 1963 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
